  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAB/GEO- Implementation Approach for Advancing the MAB/GEO Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will support Egypt and Sudan in advancing the implementation of the MAB Programme by promoting policy dialogue, strengthening stakeholder coordination, and enhancing biosphere reserve management practices in line with the Hangzhou Strategic Action Plan. The activity will also build national capacities and foster collaboration through technical support, consultations, and knowledge-sharing platforms. In parallel, it will empower youth and accelerate the development of new biosphere reserves and geoparks, contributing to sustainable development and stronger engagement in UNESCO global networks.</narrative>
  </description>
